@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

InitialState : User starts the notification customization interface
InitialState --> CustomizingNotifications : User selects to customize notifications

CustomizingNotifications : User is customizing notification settings
CustomizingNotifications --> SavingProfile : User saves the custom notification profile
CustomizingNotifications --> ManagingNotifications : User decides to manage existing notification profiles

SavingProfile : Saving the custom notification profile
SavingProfile --> CustomizingNotifications : User continues customizing
SavingProfile --> ManagingNotifications : User switches to manage profiles
SavingProfile --> [*] : User exits after saving

ManagingNotifications : Managing existing notification profiles
ManagingNotifications --> SwitchingProfile : User switches to a different profile
ManagingNotifications --> DeletingProfile : User deletes a profile
ManagingNotifications --> [*] : User exits after managing

SwitchingProfile : Switching to a different notification profile
SwitchingProfile --> ManagingNotifications : Returns to managing profiles

DeletingProfile : Deleting a notification profile
DeletingProfile --> ManagingNotifications : Returns to managing profiles

[*] <-- FinalState
@enduml
